2,Teke-Nzikou Language (NZU) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/nzu/,Teke-Nzikou is a stable indigenous language of Congo. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Teke-Nzikou,Niger-Congo
